# The PokéNav Match Call texts of the rivals (D-243) and Mr. Stone (D-258). No rival registers the player while
# they wear the uniform (D-256): the Sootopolis aftermath swaps Brendan's and May's numbers, Brendan passes on
# Steven's and May Wally's (data/scripts/draconid/rival_numbers.pory), so this test starts from act5_turn.ss
# (tests/act5.play, run in the same -o directory first), checks the four flags the scene set, and calls the rivals' revealed
# tables (data/scripts/draconid/rival_calls.pory); then Mr. Stone's calls by the Devon Goods choice
# (data/scripts/draconid/devon_goods.pory). act5.play never meets the Rustboro scientist, so the PokéNav's Match
# Call feature is switched on by hand. Each call is made through the real PokéNav (START, POKéNAV, MATCH CALL,
# the contact, CALL) and expect_text checks gStringVar4 holds the text the table should pick. The Match Call list
# shows Mr. Stone, Brendan, May and Wally in that order (the header order).
loadstate act5_turn.ss
setflag FLAG_DEBUG_NO_ENCOUNTER
setflag FLAG_DEBUG_NO_TRAINER_SEE
expect_var VAR_DRACONID_REPUTATION 2
expect_flag FLAG_ENABLE_RIVAL_MATCH_CALL 1
expect_flag FLAG_ENABLE_BRENDAN_MATCH_CALL 1
expect_flag FLAG_ENABLE_WALLY_MATCH_CALL 1
expect_flag FLAG_REGISTERED_STEVEN_POKENAV 1
setflag FLAG_SYS_POKENAV_GET
setflag FLAG_HAS_MATCH_CALL
setflag FLAG_ADDED_MATCH_CALL_TO_POKENAV
# (the saved state ends a scene: let the field settle before the first START)
run 120
mash B 300

# --- right after the turn: each rival's first call as a friend (Wally says sorry)
bagcursor POCKET_ITEMS 0
run 20
press START 2 40
press DOWN 2 10
press DOWN 2 10
press DOWN 2 10
press A 2 200
press DOWN 2 20
press DOWN 2 20
press A 2 150
press DOWN 2 20
press DOWN 2 20
press A 2 60
press A 2 150
press A 2 90
shot 01_may_after_turn
expect_text Draconid_Text_MayCallRevealed1
mash B 1800

bagcursor POCKET_ITEMS 0
run 20
press START 2 40
press DOWN 2 10
press DOWN 2 10
press DOWN 2 10
press A 2 200
press DOWN 2 20
press DOWN 2 20
press A 2 150
press DOWN 2 20
press A 2 60
press A 2 150
press A 2 90
shot 02_brendan_after_turn
expect_text Draconid_Text_BrendanCallRevealed1
mash B 1800

bagcursor POCKET_ITEMS 0
run 20
press START 2 40
press DOWN 2 10
press DOWN 2 10
press DOWN 2 10
press A 2 200
press DOWN 2 20
press DOWN 2 20
press A 2 150
press DOWN 2 20
press DOWN 2 20
press DOWN 2 20
press A 2 60
press A 2 150
press A 2 90
shot 03_wally_sorry
expect_text Draconid_Text_WallyCallRevealed1
mash B 1800

